<title>CHINA: China's Jan-April coal imports down 70.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China's Jan-April coal imports down 70.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 340,000 tonnes of coal in the first four months of 1997, down 70.9 percent from the same period last year, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   IMPORTS JAN-APRIL     APRIL  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal     340,000		 30,000	-70.9</p>
<p>	   EXPORTS JAN-APRIL     APRIL  YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Coal    8,600,000	    2,440,000     +32.1</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
